<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36443" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνώμοτ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄμνυμι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bound by oath,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅρκων οἷσιν ἦν ἐνώμοτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					1113
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάρτυρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Deor.Conc.</u>
					15
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				<i>on oath,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Caes.</u>
					47
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>confirmed by oaths,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνθῆκαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLond.</u>
					1.113.1
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					904.3
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(v A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., <i>conspirator,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sert.</u>
				26
			</span></i>.</div>
